<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the US$7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles, final</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat Carlos Moya (Spain) 6-2 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Mixed doubles, final</p>
<p>3-Manon Bollegraf (Netherlands)/Rick Leach (U.S.) beat Larisa</p>
<p>Neiland (Latvia)/John-Laffnie de Jager (South Africa) 6-3 6-7</p>
<p>(5-7) 7-5.</p>
</text>
